{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "b6e2a4c1-5f0d-4e0a-9c57-7d1c1b6f0a11",
		"name": "Veterinarian",
		"description": "Pruebas del API para el recurso Veterinarian (/veterinarians).\n\nOrden de ejecucion: crear -> listar/filtrar -> obtener -> editar -> borrar. Los emails se generan con Date.now(), asi que la coleccion se puede ejecutar varias veces sin reiniciar el back.\n\nVariables globales que deja la coleccion: veterinarian_id (se conserva, lo usan VeterinarianFollowUps y VeterinarianMedicalEvents), veterinarian_id_2 (se borra), veterinarian_email_1, veterinarian_email_2.\n\nPendiente (no hay endpoints para crear FollowUp/MedicalEvent): borrar un veterinario con seguimientos o eventos medicos (412).",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Crear un veterinario",
			"request": {
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [
					{
						"key": "Content-Type",
						"value": "application/json"
					}
				],
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/veterinarians",
					"host": [
						"{{baseUrl}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"veterinarians"
					]
				},
				"body": {
					"mode": "raw",
					"raw": "{\n    \"firstName\": \"Laura\",\n    \"lastName\": \"Gomez\",\n    \"email\": \"{{veterinarian_email_1}}\",\n    \"phone\": \"3001234567\",\n    \"specialization\": \"Medicina general\",\n    \"availability\": \"Lunes a viernes 8:00-17:00\"\n}",
					"options": {
						"raw": {
							"language": "json"
						}
					}
				}
			},
			"response": [],
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "prerequest",
					"script": {
						"exec": [
							"pm.globals.set(\"veterinarian_email_1\", \"veterinario1.\" + Date.now() + \"@patitas.org\");"
						],
						"type": "text/javascript"
					}
				},
				{
					"listen": "test",
					"script": {
						"exec": [
							"var data = pm.response.json()",
							"",
							"pm.globals.set(\"veterinarian_id\", data.id);",
							"",
							"pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {",
							"   pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
							"});",
							"",
							"pm.test(\"Veterinarian is returned with the sent data\", function () {",
							"   var data = pm.response.json();",
							"",
							"   pm.expect(data.email).to.eql(pm.globals.get(\"veterinarian_email_1\"));",
							"   pm.expect(data.specialization).to.eql(\"Medicina general\");",
							"   pm.expect(data.availability).to.eql(\"Lunes a viernes 8:00-17:00\");",
							"});"
						],
						"type": "text/javascript"
					}
				}
			]
		},
